  /// Describes whether StackSets automatically deploys to Organizations
  /// accounts that are added to a target organization or organizational unit
  /// (OU). Valid only if the StackSet uses service-managed permissions.
  pub auto_deployment: AutoDeployment? = None
  /// Describes how the IAM roles required for StackSet operations are
